title: "career-hub: canonical career materials for Daniel Palacios"
abstract: >-
  Source of truth for Daniel Palacios's publications, research software,
  curriculum vitae, and public profile site. Publication and software metadata
  are maintained as BibTeX records; the website and CV are generated from them.
